# Normalize line endings: store text as LF in the repo and check out as LF on
# every platform. This repo is bash-script-heavy (providers, tests), where CRLF
# can break execution, and the prior mixed CRLF/LF state caused spurious EOL
# churn in diffs whenever a Unix-style editor touched a CRLF file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Be explicit for the executable/text types we ship.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.bats text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
